e><surname>Nomaguchi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Teramoto</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Yu</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Markoff</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Padmanabhan</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Requirements for West Nile virus (-)- and (+)-strand subgenomic RNA synthesis in vitro by the viral RNA-dependent RNA polymerase expressed in Escherichia coli</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>2004</year><volume>279</volume><fpage>12141</fpage><lpage>12151</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14699096</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1074/jbc.M310839200</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Guyatt</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Westaway</surname><given-names>EG</given-names></name><name><surname>Khromykh</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Expression and purification of enzymatically active recombinant RNA-dependent RNA polymerase (NS5) of the flavivirus Kunjin</article-title><source>J Virol Methods</source><year>2001</year><volume>92</volume><fpage>37</fpage><lpage>44</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11164916</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0166-0934(00)00270-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tan</surname><given-names>BH</given-names></name><name><surname>Fu</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Sugrue</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Yap</surname><given-names>EH</given-names></name><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>YC</given-names></name><name><surname>Tan</surname><given-names>YH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Recombinant dengue type 1 virus NS5 protein e